hero_sub,"The Columbia Bills — Columbia, South Carolina"
hero_tagline,A US Masters Swimming club based at the Charles R. Drew Wellness Center
about_text,"We are the Columbia Bills, a US Masters Swimming team based at the Charles R. Drew Wellness Center in Columbia, South Carolina. Our members range from fitness swimmers to nationally competitive athletes across all age groups."
about_text_2,"Whether you're returning to the pool after years away or training for your next championship meet, our coached workouts and supportive team environment will help you reach your goals."
about_text_3,USMS membership (or 30-day trial membership) is required for all practices. A Drew Wellness Center membership or day pass is required for all practices. 
schedule_note,USMS membership (or 30-day trial membership) is required for all practices. A Drew Wellness Center membership or day pass is required for all practices.
alert_message,The Drew Wellness Center has reopened as of 7/22/26. All practices are now located at the Drew Wellness Center.